'''Elyanna Morejón''' (born 25 March 1987) is a [[Balisca|Baliscan]] politician of [[W:Palestinians|Palestinian]] origin, currently serving as the incumbent [[Secretariat of Finance and Civil Service (Balisca)|Secretary of Finance and Civil Service]], since January 2025, and as a confederal delegate representing [[Jafa (commune district)|Jafa]].

